WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.240
- So you fell from a bike, like again.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.600
So like what, why do you
keep getting on bikes?

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.588
- The assassin.

00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:10.230
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.063
- It wasn't me.
- [Kelly] How are you feeling?

00:00:11.063 --> 00:00:14.880
- Ever since Sofia joined the
show, we've all had accidents.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.305
- [Kelly] Wait, is this true?

00:00:16.305 --> 00:00:17.138
- Yep.

00:00:17.138 --> 00:00:18.840
- They say that, but I don't believe it,

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.234
because nothing has happened to me.

00:00:21.234 --> 00:00:22.225
- [Simon] One by one.

00:00:22.225 --> 00:00:23.650
- I haven't even, in
two years, gotten COVID.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.340
Not even once, so I don't know.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.790
- Oh, you girl, you better be knocking

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.810
on that wood right now.

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.325
I'm knocking for you.
- [Terry] Yeah!

00:00:29.325 --> 00:00:30.890
(audience clapping)

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:32.990
- I don't know why he
blames me for everything.

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:34.010
- [Simon] I'm just saying.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.720
- Wait, so what happened to y'all?

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.080
Did something happen to y'all?

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.450
- Well, one by one,
we've all had accidents

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.020
ever since Sophia joined the show.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.660
Howie's not here.
- I mean, it is kind of true.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.780
When Sophia came the first year we met,

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.270
the next day, I was sick.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:48.103
- [Sofia] She was sick.

00:00:48.103 --> 00:00:50.095
- [Simon] I was ill. Then I broke my back.

00:00:50.095 --> 00:00:51.140
- I mean, they say that I was trying

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.105
to judge the whole show by myself.

00:00:54.105 --> 00:00:55.294
(Terry and Kelly laughing)

00:00:55.294 --> 00:00:56.185
- And host.

00:00:56.185 --> 00:00:57.018
- And host. (laughs)

00:00:57.018 --> 00:00:57.854
- Sofia's the only one left at the table.

00:00:57.854 --> 00:00:59.040
(Simon laughing)

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.980
- Oh my gosh. I don't think
that you're a bad juju.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:03.280
I think you're great juju.

